  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Air travel, the oil market and the strong dollar drew attention. IBM’s new home computer showed how quickly technology was changing.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Your starting price and the full five-year path mattered. An exciting new product was only one part of a company’s investment story.",
    "what_faded_away": "The unusual baseball season and immediate arguments about air traffic did not provide a dependable five-year investing plan.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody could know that Coca-Cola would lead these seven choices. Popularity, recent returns and a clever story were not guarantees.",
